OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain in the
OL,6,Fwest at first otherwise dry with clear
OL,7,Fspells in the evening. Cloud will
OL,8,Fspread east from the late evening with
OL,9,Frain following towards the morning.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,12,Fthrough the day, but some brighter
OL,13,Fspells across the Greater Glasgow
OL,14,Farea. Rain then turns heavier and more
OL,15,Fpersistent in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
